# Grenade cook: hold G to pull the pin and let the fuse burn in the hand, then release to throw.
# The throw is aimed at the ground ahead of the zombies, as in grenade.steps. The fuse starts at the press, so a grenade held for 60 frames and thrown explodes 150 frames after the press, 90 frames after the release, not 150 frames after the release.
# The shot 01 shows the left hand with the grenade raised at the lower left. The shot 02 comes right after the release, and shows the swing or the throw that follows it.
expect hud.grenades 2
expect hud.points 0
until zombies.alive 4 300
wait 40
aim
look 0 220
hold grenade
wait 25
state 01-cooking
shot 01-cooking
expect hud.grenades 1
expect_not hud.grenade_fuse 2.5
wait 35
release grenade
shot 02-release
state 02-release
wait 12
look 0 -190
wait 18
state 03-thrown
shot 03-thrown
expect hud.grenades 1
expect hud.points 0
wait 90
state 04-blast
shot 04-blast
expect_not hud.points 0
expect_not zombies.alive 4
